  'move:high-jump-kick | High Jump Kick | #136 | fighting | physical | power 130, pp 10, accuracy 90, priority 0, effect chance — | generation-i | If the user misses, it takes half the damage it would have inflicted in recoil. | effect: Inflicts regular damage. If this move misses, is blocked by Protect or Detect, or has no effect, the user takes damage equal to half of its max HP rounded down. This move cannot be used while Gravity is in effect.',
