  'move:tri-attack | Tri Attack | #161 | normal | special | power 80, pp 10, accuracy 100, priority 0, effect chance 20 | generation-i | Has a chance to burn, freeze, or paralyze the target. | effect: Inflicts regular damage. Has a chance to burn, freeze, or paralyze the target. One of these effects is selected at random; they do not each have independent chances to occur.',
