  'ability:friend-guard | Friend Guard | #132 | generation-v | Decreases all direct damage taken by friendly Pokémon to 0.75×. | effect: All friendly Pokémon take 0.75× as much direct damage from moves while this Pokémon is in battle. This effect stacks if multiple allied Pokémon have it.',
  'ability:weak-armor | Weak Armor | #133 | generation-v | Raises Speed and lowers Defense by one stage each upon being hit by a physical move. | effect: Whenever a physical move hits this Pokémon, its Speed rises one stage and its Defense falls one stage. This ability triggers on every hit of a multiple-hit move.',
