  'ability:imposter | Imposter | #150 | generation-v | Transforms upon entering battle. | effect: This Pokémon transforms into a random opponent upon entering battle. This effect is identical to the move Transform.',
  "ability:infiltrator | Infiltrator | #151 | generation-v | Bypasses Light Screen, Reflect, and Safeguard. | effect: This Pokémon's moves ignore Light Screen, Reflect, and Safeguard.",
  "ability:moxie | Moxie | #153 | generation-v | Raises Attack one stage upon KOing a Pokémon. | effect: This Pokémon's Attack rises one stage upon knocking out another Pokémon, even a friendly Pokémon. This ability does not take effect when the Pokémon indirectly causes another Pokémon to faint, e.g. through poison or Spikes. If this Pokémon knocks out a Pokémon with Mummy, the former's ability will change without taking effect.",
